Calm Feed vendors no third-party code. It installs these packages at runtime:

FastAPI         MIT
Uvicorn         BSD-3-Clause
HTTPX           BSD-3-Clause
itsdangerous    BSD-3-Clause
PyYAML          MIT
python-dotenv   BSD-3-Clause
tzdata          Apache-2.0

Videos play through the official YouTube IFrame Player API, loaded from
youtube.com and subject to YouTube's terms.
